---
name: button
type: registry:ui
title: Button
description: A clickable button with several visual variants.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: src/lib/components/ui/button/button.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/button/button.svelte"
  - path: src/lib/components/ui/button/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/button/index.ts"
---

Buttons trigger an action when clicked. Use the `variant` and `size` props to match the surrounding UI, or pass `href` to render as a link.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Button } from "../../components/button";
</script>

<Button>Click me</Button>
<Button variant="outline">Outline</Button>
<Button variant="destructive">Delete</Button>
```
